        "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:35:08.824Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome, Jashugan! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Yeah, Powerhound is correct. If it said something like the following, then he would <strong>not</strong> heal if nothing was destroyed (or available to be destroyed):<br>\n“Destroy 1 target with 3 or fewer HP. <strong>If you do,</strong> Haka regain 3HP.”</p>",
